OL,3,GNEWSACommission holding final round of
OL,4,Ameetings on Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission is holding a
OL,7,Ffinal round of meetings before coming
OL,8,Fto a decision on the Drumcree dispute.
OL,10,FThe five-person commission must decide
OL,11,Fwhether to allow the Orange Order to
OL,12,Fmarch from Drumcree church in Portadown
OL,13,Falong the mainly nationalist Garvaghy
OL,14,FRoad on Sunday.
OL,16,FIt is one of the most contentious
OL,17,Fparade routes in Northern Ireland.
OL,19,FA decision on whether or not to
OL,20,Fre-route the planned march may not be
OL,21,Fannounced until Friday.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
